msgstr ""
"**Security Monitoring**: Detecting people, vehicles, and abnormal objects"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:24
msgid "**智能交通**：车辆计数、车型识别、违章检测"
msgstr ""
"**Intelligent transportation**: vehicle counting, vehicle model "
