#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:26
msgid "**零售分析**：商品识别、货架检测、客流分析"
msgstr ""
"**Retail Analysis**: Product identification, shelf detection, customer flow "
"analysis"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:27
msgid "**农业应用**：作物病虫害检测、成熟度判断"
msgstr ""
"**Agricultural applications**: Crop disease and pest detection, maturity "
"judgment"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:30
