#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:107
msgid "使用技巧与最佳实践"
msgstr "Tips and best practices"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:109
msgid "**置信度阈值调整**"
msgstr "**Confidence threshold adjustment**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:111
msgid "初始建议值：0.5"
msgstr "Initial recommended value: 0.5"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:112
msgid "高精度场景（如工业质检）：0.7-0.9"
msgstr ""
"High-precision scenarios (such as industrial quality inspection): 0.7-0.9"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:113
msgid "高召回场景（如安防监控）：0.3-0.5"
msgstr "High recall scenarios (such as security monitoring): 0.3-0.5"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:115
msgid "**性能优化**"
msgstr "**Performance Optimization**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:117
msgid "对于高分辨率图像，建议启用GPU加速"
msgstr ""
"For high-resolution images, it is recommended to enable GPU acceleration"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:118
msgid "批量处理时可调整batch size以提高吞吐量"
msgstr ""
"Batch size can be adjusted during batch processing to improve throughput"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:119
msgid "实时应用建议使用较小的模型以降低延迟"
msgstr ""
"Real-time applications recommend using smaller models to reduce latency"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:121
msgid "**处理重叠物体**"
msgstr "**Handling overlapping objects**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:123
msgid "模型会自动进行NMS（非极大值抑制）去除重复检测"
msgstr ""
"The model will automatically perform NMS (non-maximum suppression) to remove"
" duplicate detections"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:124
msgid "如需调整NMS阈值，可在高级设置中配置"
msgstr ""
"If you need to adjust the NMS threshold, you can configure it in the "
"advanced settings."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:126
msgid "**提高检测精度**"
msgstr "**Improve detection accuracy**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:128
msgid "确保训练数据包含足够的样本多样性"
msgstr "Ensure training data contains sufficient sample diversity"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:129
msgid "使用数据增强提高模型泛化能力"
msgstr "Use data augmentation to improve model generalization capabilities"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:130
msgid "针对特定场景调整置信度阈值"
msgstr "Adjust confidence thresholds for specific scenarios"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:133
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:135
msgid "**Q: 检测结果中出现很多误检怎么办？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: What should I do if there are many false positives in the test "
"results?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:137
msgid "A: 可以提高 ``confidence`` 阈值来过滤低置信度的检测结果。建议从0.5开始逐步调整。"
msgstr ""
"A: You can increase the ``confidence`` threshold to filter out low-"
"confidence detection results.It is recommended to gradually adjust starting "
"from 0.5."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:139
msgid "**Q: 小物体检测效果不好？**"
msgstr "**Q: The small object detection effect is not good?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:141
msgid "A: 小物体检测是目标检测的难点。建议："
msgstr ""
"A: Small object detection is the difficulty of target detection.suggestion:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:143
msgid "使用更高分辨率的输入图像"
msgstr "Use a higher resolution input image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:144
msgid "在训练时增加小物体样本"
msgstr "Add small object samples during training"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:145
msgid "降低该类别的置信度阈值"
msgstr "Lower the confidence threshold for this category"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:147
msgid "**Q: 边界框坐标是相对坐标还是绝对坐标？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: Are the bounding box coordinates relative or absolute coordinates?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:149
msgid "A: 边界框坐标为绝对像素坐标，与输入图像的分辨率对应。"
msgstr ""
"A: The bounding box coordinates are absolute pixel coordinates, "
"corresponding to the resolution of the input image."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:151
msgid "**Q: 如何统计特定类别的数量？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to count the quantity of a specific category?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_object_detection.rst:153
msgid "A: 可以在下游节点中对 ``detections`` 数组进行过滤和计数，或使用专门的统计节点。"
msgstr ""
"A: The ``detections`` array can be filtered and counted in downstream nodes,"
" or using a dedicated statistics node."

